  "title_query": "I am thinking of starting a science fiction book club with my friends, and want to have a better understanding of the evolution of the genre. I want to make sure that we select books that are part of the traditional canon of science fiction as well as books from contemporary voices and/or underrepresented perspectives.\nI need information on how the genre of science fiction in literature has changed and evolved over time. What has influenced science fiction earlier last century and how has the genre more recently developed? How has it changed from the world of HG Wells to the current authors? Have authors from other demographics (women authors, or people of color) made an impact?",
